D31. Pastime of go-getters. ~ GETTING
D33. It's the man who pays—this is what the woman does. ~ OWE
D34. A highball Ruth is not supposed to hit during the playing season. ~ RYE
D35. Santa Claus (you must be very wise to know this). ~ DAD
D36. This should look good. ~ EYE
D38. Any woman's club contains at least one. ~ CAT
D39. This word is applied to something not so young. ~ OLE
D40. Mademoiselle in Japan. ~ SAN
D41. This is usually at sea. ~ USN
